          "type": "text",
          "name": "Text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Hosfu is a <strong>police-grade device</strong> specifically designed to display your real-time Blood Alcohol Concentration (BAC) with absolute precision, starting from 0.000%. This is an <strong>easy-to-use</strong>, highly accurate device that anyone can carry and test themselves in <strong>just a few seconds, without any guesswork or hesitation. </strong>Taking control of your safety before turning the ignition is one of the most important decisions you can make for yourself, your family, and everyone on the road.</p><p><strong>Because the feeling of being \"fine\" can be a deadly illusion. But Hosfu always tells the truth.</strong></p>",
