            "enable_custom_style": false,
            "heading_padding_vertical": 12,
            "heading_padding_horizontal": 10,
            "content_padding_vertical": 10,
            "content_padding_horizontal": 10,
            "closed_state_border": "#dddddd",
            "closed_state_header_bg": "#f9f9f9",
            "closed_state_header_text": "#121212",
            "closed_state_row_icon": "#121212",
            "closed_state_collapse_icon": "#1a237e",
            "closed_state_collapse_icon_solid": "#ffffff",
            "closed_state_collapse_bg": "#121212",
            "closed_state_content_bg": "#f9f9f9",
            "closed_state_content_text": "#121212",
            "open_colors_on_hover": true,
            "open_state_border": "#d5aeea",
            "open_state_header_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_header_text": "#000000",
            "open_state_row_icon": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_collapse_icon": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_collapse_icon_solid": "#ffffff",
            "open_state_collapse_bg": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_content_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_content_text": "#121212",
            "content": "<p>It’s designed for speed and simplicity when you need it most. Just follow 3 easy steps:</p><ol><li><strong>Power On & Wait:</strong> Press the power button. The device will quickly warm up and the screen will display \"Wait\".</li><li><strong>Blow steadily:</strong> Once the screen says \"Blow\", exhale continuously into the mouthpiece until you hear the beep.</li><li><strong>Read your exact number:</strong> Your BAC level will instantly appear. The smart display is color-coded (<strong>Green</strong> for OK, <strong>Yellow</strong> for Caution, <strong>Red</strong> for Danger) so you know exactly where you stand in seconds.</li></ol>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 0,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
