            "open_state_collapse_bg": "#1a237e",
            "open_state_content_bg": "#fefaff",
            "open_state_content_text": "#121212",
            "content": "<p>It replaces deadly guesswork with absolute certainty. Customers keep Hosfu in their cars because it consistently delivers reliable, repeatable results test after test, with lightning-fast recovery times. It’s not just a gadget; it’s an essential safety tool that provides peace of mind, protects families, and prevents life-altering mistakes before the ignition is ever turned. Plus, backed by a <strong>3-Year Warranty</strong>, it's built for long-term trust.</p>",
