          "settings": {
            "post_author": "Edgar Moran",
            "post_author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/TB2YfxPnypnpuFjSZFIXXXh2VXa__12466441_jpg_400x400_jpg.webp",
            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "5h ago",
            "post_text": "<p>I had tried cheap breathalyzers before, but they were never consistent enough to trust. The Hosfu is simple, fast, and fits perfectly in my glovebox. The clear color-coded screen gives me the exact data I need to make the right choice every time.</p>",
            "post_image": "shopify://shop_images/Untitled_image_19.png",
