          "settings": {
            "post_author": "Kim Caton",
            "post_author_avatar": "shopify://shop_images/istockphoto-1285156699-612x612.jpg",
            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "10h ago",
            "post_text": "<p>The biggest shift was how much peace of mind I have now. I can easily bring it to dinners or keep it in the center console. It’s discreet, recharges fast, and delivers police-grade results you can actually trust. Worth every penny to protect my license and my family.</p>",
