            "post_author_verified": false,
            "post_time": "1 day ago",
            "post_text": "<p>I was skeptical at first, but the quality of the HOSFU breathalyzer is impressive. The solid build and premium feel are immediately apparent, and the setup was a breeze. I got immediate, clear results on my first test trip. It's so much better than just trusting how I felt. Feeling more 'in control' of my safety now. Highly recommend for anyone on the fence!</p>",
