    "faq_section": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How is Hosfu different from cheap breathalyzers?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Unlike cheap devices that use unreliable semiconductor chips, Hosfu uses advanced, police-grade electrochemical sensors. This means our device specifically isolates alcohol and will not give you \"false positives\" from keto diets, breath mints, or spicy foods. You get absolute accuracy starting from 0.000%.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "How long should I wait after drinking to take a test?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>For the most accurate results, we recommend waiting at least 15 to 20 minutes after your last drink or meal. This allows any residual alcohol in your mouth to dissipate, ensuring the device measures your true Blood Alcohol Concentration (BAC) from your deep lung air.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Who is this device designed for?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Hosfu is built for any responsible adult who drinks socially. Whether you enjoy a single glass of wine at dinner, a couple of beers after work, or attend weekend parties, this device is for anyone who refuses to gamble their life and future on a \"guess.\"</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Is it rechargeable?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! Hosfu features a built-in, long-lasting rechargeable battery with a modern USB-C charging port. A single quick charge provides enough power for hundreds of consistent tests, so it’s always ready in your glovebox or pocket when you need it.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Can I share it with my friends and family?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely. Your Hosfu comes with interchangeable, washable mouthpieces. You can easily snap on a fresh mouthpiece so everyone in your group can check their numbers safely and hygienically before heading home.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_6": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "Can I use this reading as legal defense against the police?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>No. While Hosfu utilizes professional-grade technology for high accuracy, it is intended strictly as a personal safety and reference tool to help you make responsible decisions. It should never be used to justify drinking and driving or as legal evidence in a court of law.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_7": {
          "type": "collapsible-row-content",
          "settings": {
            "open": false,
            "heading": "What if I am not completely satisfied with it?",
            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>We are fully confident in our police-grade accuracy. That’s why every Hosfu is backed by our <strong>100-Day Risk-Free Trial</strong> and a <strong>3-Year Warranty</strong>. If the device doesn't give you total peace of mind, simply return it for a full, hassle-free refund.</p>",
            "page": ""
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
